      "summary": "Provenance verified (single parent 00fbe8e, tree 756d812). On Pi, a literal imm-run entry now mints an entry token bound to the session and the workspace realpath. Enroll and batch start keep their single dialog. retire_stale_batch is gated by the entry, and under a live token it records a pi-entry- ref bound to the plan digest. Shutdown, pause and settle all revoke the token. The manifest moved into a host-neutral module. Tests cover all six AC2 refusals with byte-identical batch state and no report, plus the rework-exit dialog.",
