          "acceptance_id": "AC2",
          "summary": "The agent_before_settle early exit for a non-completed outcome or canContinue=false calls reset() but not revoke(), so a run that stops this way (for example a user interrupt) keeps its live entry token. The token is revoked only on the continuation pause, settle and error branches.",
