          "evidence": {
            "trigger": "Under a live imm-run token, the turn settles with outcome !== 'completed' (user abort). The continuation resets, but piPhaseEntries keeps run_live and the token, so a later retire_stale_batch in the same session and workspace runs without a dialog. The AC2 'paused' case (the continuation pause decision) is revoked and tested; this interrupt path is not, and whether it counts as a pause is not settled by the Spec.",
